## Pattern

Single-page service site, mobile-first. Section order:

```
[ HERO ] → [ TRUST BAR ] → [ SERVICES ] → [ PROOF ] →
[ ABOUT ] → [ FAQ ] → [ FINAL CTA ] → [ FOOTER ]
```

